      "value": "I was not able to reproduce this, steps I have done:\n1. Request an Invite from my test account in his Home World (Invite Only).\n2. Accept the Invite Request with with the mentioned test account.\n3. Accept the invite I now got from the test account and join them.\n4. After loading in to the world, press Go Home.\n5. When in home try requesting an Invite from the test account again.\nWith this I wasn't able to get the issue you described, with both requesting through the Quick Menu and through the Main Menu. The only thing I could notice was that the request Invite button in the Main Menu showed \"Join\" for a nano second before displaying as \"Req Invite\".\nDid you do anything different / are you able to reproduce the issue you have described?",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
